title: lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/tw5/tiddlers/sigil-widget
tags: $:/tags/Global lar:///ha.ka.ba/tags/SharktoothSigil
lar-kind: pragma
lar-pono-uri: lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/widget
lar-open-pattern: <<~!?\s*widget\s+name=`(~?[\w-]+)`(?:\s+params=`([^`]*)`)?(?:\s+([^>]*?))?\s*>>
lar-close-pattern: <<~\/widget\s*>>
lar-render: declares
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<!-- \widget — English alias for the TW5 \widget pragma.
     No direct Hawaiian equivalent; the ~ prefix is the Lares convention.

     <<~ widget name=`~name` params=`params`>>body<<~/widget>> declares a named widget
     callable as <<~name ...>> via the ~ dispatcher.
     lar-kind: pragma — produces no render output; the sigil serves as the declaration.

     The ~ prefix convention: <<~ widget name=`~mana` params=`uri:""`>>...<<~/widget>>
     registers a new mana sigil callable as <<~ mana uri=`lar:///uri`>>. -->
